msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Enumerate up to %1 fruits."
msgstr "شمارش تا حداکثر %1 میوه."

#: activities/enumerate/resource/2/Data.qml:13
#: activities/enumerate/resource/3/Data.qml:13
#: activities/enumerate/resource/4/Data.qml:13
#, qt-format
