msgstr "داخل"

#: activities/positions/resource/1/Data.qml:39
#: activities/positions/resource/2/Data.qml:45
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Select the image where the child is inside the box."
msgstr "تصویری را که در آن کودک داخل جعبه است انتخاب کنید."

#. it refers to the above position
#: activities/positions/resource/1/Data.qml:44
#: activities/positions/resource/2/Data.qml:50
