#: activities/positions/resource/2/Data.qml:51
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Select the image where the child is above the box."
msgstr "تصویری را که در آن کودک بالای جعبه است انتخاب کنید."

#. it refers to the beneath position
#: activities/positions/resource/1/Data.qml:50
#: activities/positions/resource/2/Data.qml:56
