#: activities/scalesboard_weight/resource/4/Data.qml:31
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid ""
"The kilogram is a unit of mass, a property which corresponds to the common perception of how \"heavy\" an object is. \n"
" Drop weights on the left side to balance the scales."
